# 🎯 7. Take accountability

Naval emphasizes attaching your reputation to your work.

When you take responsibility for outcomes, you create:

* Trust
* Credibility
* Reputation
* Opportunity

People become willing to give you greater responsibility when they know you will stand behind your decisions.

