Example: Combining computer science, AI, product development, and an understanding of real-world problems can help you build valuable technology products.

2\. Build instead of only working for a salary

Don't think only about how much you can earn per hour. Think about what you can create that continues delivering value.

Examples:

- Software applications.
- Digital products.
- Online platforms.
- Businesses.
- Intellectual property.

3\. Use leverage

Leverage allows you to multiply the results of your effort.

